  "details": "The VRC_ObjectPool should have an option where it automatically assigns one object to each player on join, and then also returns it to the pool when the player leaves. \n\nThis is an often required use case for an object pool, and something that should better be handled by VRChat than by our own individual Udon implementations (which are never perfect).\n\nIdeally, it should also be possible to then ask the object pool to return the object assigned to a certain player API, or ask it for the player API related to a given object.",
